          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tears of Isha" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description">In your Command phase, select one friendly **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit within 6&quot; of this model. If one or more models in that unit are destroyed, you can return one destroyed model to that unit. Otherwise, one model in that unit regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each unit can only be selected for this ability once per turn.</characteristic>
